      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Colonel Henry Caldwell received the Granby township in 1803, and John Horner built the first sawmill there in 1813.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Granby%2C_Quebec",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Between 1981 and 1997, Granby hosted a Quebec Major Junior Hockey League team, first the Bisons then the Prédateurs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
